WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.941
Welcome to İlker Tekin’s salon, on Poeijersstraat in Eindhoven.

00:00:05.241 --> 00:00:08.290
In a few minutes you’ll see the app for your clients,

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:10.993
and the salon screen for your team, live in 3D.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:18.231
Open the app and you first see a hair toss: an AI video, labelled as one.

00:00:18.231 --> 00:00:19.807
Then the salon opens.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.950
The home screen greets your client by name, with today’s appointment.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.380
If her stylist runs late, she sees it right away, at the top of the screen.

00:00:30.317 --> 00:00:34.689
Below that: how busy the salon is right now, and how long you wait if you walk in.

00:00:34.989 --> 00:00:37.345
Plus twenty things the website can’t do yet,

00:00:37.345 --> 00:00:39.968
from trying on a colour to a drink at your chair.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:46.155
Under Book now is the salon’s full menu, with the real prices.

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:49.963
Choose your hair length, and the prices adjust.

00:00:52.217 --> 00:00:55.501
Choose a treatment, your stylist, a day and a time.

00:00:58.917 --> 00:01:01.279
Confirm, and your appointment is booked.

00:01:03.483 --> 00:01:07.084
Under Looks you swipe through hairstyles in 3D, with the price.

00:01:07.084 --> 00:01:10.857
Save your favourite, and your stylist sees it at your appointment.

00:01:11.817 --> 00:01:16.346
In the fitting room the AI finds the hair in a photo and colours it:

00:01:16.346 --> 00:01:18.212
copper, honey or ice blonde.

00:01:18.512 --> 00:01:22.979
Drag across the photo to see before and after. The photo stays on the phone.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.587
In the Club your client collects points,

00:01:26.587 --> 00:01:29.566
from Glow to Icon, and trades them for a treatment.

00:01:30.617 --> 00:01:34.317
The hair passport keeps every visit, with the colour formula.

00:01:34.317 --> 00:01:38.079
So she always gets the same colour, even with another stylist.

00:01:39.017 --> 00:01:42.676
And the frizz forecast looks at the humidity in Eindhoven,

00:01:42.676 --> 00:01:44.947
and says what your hair needs today.

00:01:45.883 --> 00:01:50.658
Then the salon screen, for the team. The salon is there in 3D: five chairs,

00:01:50.658 --> 00:01:53.714
the basins, the colour bar and the waiting sofa.

00:01:54.014 --> 00:01:56.465
Above each chair: the client, the treatment,

00:01:56.465 --> 00:01:58.972
and how long the colour still has to process.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.414
Click a chair, and the client card opens,

00:02:02.414 --> 00:02:04.999
with the colour formula and earlier visits.

00:02:06.917 --> 00:02:09.251
The agenda shows the day per stylist.

00:02:10.417 --> 00:02:13.154
And under Klanten, the clients, everyone is listed with her colour formula.

00:02:15.183 --> 00:02:18.803
The team stands on podiums, as high as their day is full.

00:02:19.683 --> 00:02:23.514
The week stands in colour columns, and the shop is a wall with the stock.

00:02:25.383 --> 00:02:28.461
One button, and you see it flat, in 2D.

00:02:29.717 --> 00:02:32.971
And now the best part: the app and the screen are connected.

00:02:33.817 --> 00:02:35.949
When Yara joins the walk-in queue,

00:02:35.949 --> 00:02:39.086
she is on the screen at once, on the waiting sofa.

00:02:40.717 --> 00:02:43.687
When she orders a cappuccino, the bar knows.

00:02:47.617 --> 00:02:50.203
Her shop order is ready to pick up.

00:02:53.317 --> 00:02:57.065
And when she pays with a tip for Selin, it comes in straight away.

00:02:59.883 --> 00:03:02.901
Want to see a whole day? Press “Speel de dag af”, play the day.

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:08.336
The chairs fill up and empty again, from nine o’clock to closing time.

00:03:10.517 --> 00:03:15.344
That was İlker Tekin: one app for your clients, and the salon live on one screen.

00:03:15.644 --> 00:03:18.835
The clients and the team besides İlker are made up,

00:03:18.835 --> 00:03:21.587
and nothing is really booked or paid. Enjoy!
